<main class="rubusoo-page inquiry-import inquiry-import--focused">
  <header class="page-heading inquiry-import__heading"><p class="eyebrow">备用导入方式</p><h1>粘贴客户发来的内容</h1><p>如果暂时没有连接聊天插件，可以粘贴邮件或聊天记录，也可以上传客户文件。</p><%= link_to "改用聊天插件自动同步", chat_integration_path, class: "deal-back" %></header>
  <%= form_with model: @inquiry, class: "inquiry-import__workspace", multipart: true do |f| %>
    <section class="inquiry-import__composer">
      <%= f.hidden_field :source_type, value: "email" %>
      <label class="inquiry-import__prompt" for="inquiry_source_text">客户询盘</label>
      <%= f.text_area :source_text, rows: 16, placeholder: "粘贴完整的客户邮件或聊天内容…", class: "textarea inquiry-import__textarea", autofocus: true %>
      <div class="inquiry-import__upload"><div><strong>或者上传客户文件</strong><span>PDF、XLSX、CSV 或 TXT</span></div><label class="upload-control inquiry-import__file"><%= f.file_field :source_file, accept: ".pdf,.xlsx,.csv,.txt,application/pdf,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet", class: "upload-control__input" %><span class="upload-control__action"><%= t("settings_workspace.file_input.choose_file") %></span><span class="upload-control__empty"><%= t("settings_workspace.file_input.no_file_selected") %></span></label></div>
    </section>
    <aside class="inquiry-import__rail inquiry-import__rail--focused">
      <p class="section-kicker">下一步</p><h2>生成一份可审核的草稿</h2><p>系统会提取客户、商品、数量、规格和商业条款，并标出需要你确认的地方。</p>
      <%= f.submit "准备报价草稿", class: "button button--primary button--full" %>
      <details class="inquiry-import__details"><summary>系统会如何处理？</summary><ul><li>保留原始内容作为证据</li><li>优先匹配已有商品资料</li><li>价格和运费没有依据时保持空白</li></ul></details>
    </aside>
  <% end %>
</main>
